  "slug": "first-article-quality-report-form",
  "title": "First Article Quality Report Form",
  "subtitle": "Reconcile the first article build and inspection population, summarize evidence and trends, separate limitations from conclusions, assign decisions, and track follow-up.",
  "description": "A decision-ready first article quality report form that turns source records for a first production-representative article into reconciled measures, exception patterns, qualified conclusions, owned actions, and a retrievable reporting package.",
  "use_case": "Use when the design, manufacturing, or quality approval owner needs a bounded quality report for the first article build and inspection rather than a raw inspection checklist or chronological log.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
